  (text "Section 3 of the circuit notes. The DSP replaces the pedal's input network with a 5 Hz DC blocker, fi.dcblockerat(5) (chosen):\nCX2 and RX3 stand in for it. The pedal has C1 22 nF with R2 1 MOhm to the bias rail, 7.23 Hz [6] (reported),\nR1 1 MOhm across the input, and R4 1 kOhm with C4 1 nF as a radio-frequency low-pass [6]. None of those is modelled." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 198.12 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "651299d7-9d3c-54d6-9052-e5dd13bfb39c"))
